OL,3,GNEWSAMinisters examine newspaper office
OL,4,Aplans over flood risk fears
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Scottish government has been asked
OL,7,Fto decide whether plans to turn a
OL,8,Fformer newspaper office into a
OL,9,Fspecialist school should be allowed to
OL,10,Fgo ahead.
OL,12,FDumfries and Galloway Council gave its
OL,13,Fsupport to the proposals for the old
OL,14,FStandard offices on Park Lane in
OL,15,FDumfries.
OL,17,FHowever, the Scottish Environment
OL,18,FProtection Agency, said it represented
OL,19,Fa change of use from "least" to "most"
OL,20,Fvulnerable at the site next to the
OL,21,FRiver Nith.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,430,420,260,160,0,100
