OL,3,GNEWSAMinisters examine newspaper office
OL,4,Aplans over flood risk fears
OL,5,
OL,6,FDue to its holding objection, the plans
OL,7,Fhave gone to the Scottish government to
OL,8,Fdecide whether or not to "call in" the
OL,9,Fscheme in order to decide its fate.
